{title: 679 - God Be in My Head}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #679 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 679}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
God be in my head,
And in my thinking.
god be in my eyes,
And in my looking.
God be in my mouth
And in my speaking.
Oh, God be in my hear,
And in my understanding.
{end_of_verse}
